# Density Compare
# Berkelium (Bk) — real density 14.78 g/cm³. equal masses: Berkelium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Berkelium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.1mm color: #80ff40 at (-20mm, 4.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 117.9 g — the water cube is the reference
